      "\uD83C\uDF10 Step 1/3: Fetching LIVE County Demographics & Market Rents from U.S. Census Bureau ACS 5-Year API...\n   -> Pulled 3,222 real U.S. counties directly from api.census.gov.\n\uD83C\uDF10 Step 2/3: Querying HUD Open Data ArcGIS REST API (Public Housing Authorities NGDA Layer)...\n   -> Verified live connection to HUD ArcGIS FeatureServer (500 PHA records sampled).\n⚖️ Step 3/3: Loading PRRAC Source of Income (SOI) Statutory Lookup Table (State & Local Ordinances)...\n✅ Phase 1 Complete: Live Census ACS, HUD-VASH, and PRRAC SOI datasets ingested into Spark DataFrames.\n   • df_hud rows:      3,222\n   • df_soi_laws rows: 961\n   • df_pums rows:     3,222\n"
     ]
